{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"slug":[{"Plain":"MU"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"稳定同伦论","text":"稳定同伦论"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"MU"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$\\mathrm{MU}$ 是复向量丛的万有 "},{"Local":{"url":"Thom谱","text":"Thom 谱"}},{"Plain":", 它表示了复配边上同调理论. $\\mathrm{MU}$ 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"MO","text":"$\\mathrm{MO}$"}},{"Plain":" 的类比.</p>\n<p>抽象地, $\\mathrm{MU}$ 可定义为 $\\mathrm{U}$ 在"},{"Local":{"url":"球谱","text":"球谱"}},{"Plain":"上作用的"},{"Local":{"url":"余不动点","text":"余不动点"}},{"Plain":", 即余极限\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{MU} = \\operatorname{colim}(\\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{U}\\to \\mathbf{B}\\mathrm{O} \\to \\mathsf{Sp}).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>作为"},{"Local":{"url":"序列谱","text":"序列谱"}},{"Plain":", $MU$ 的第 $2k$ 项为万有 $k$ 阶复向量丛的 Thom 谱.</p>\n<h2>复配边上同调理论</h2>\n<p>对于空间 $X$, $\\mathrm {MU}^*(X)$ 是 $X$ 上一种流形的配边 (bordism) 类, 其稳定法丛上带有近复结构.</p>\n"}]}}